[I] Cmdline bookmark management utility

[T] buku is a powerful command line bookmark manager and personal textual
[T] mini-web with a private, portable SQLite database. It can import
[T] bookmarks from browsers, fetch titles, tags and descriptions from the
[T] web, search instantly and check broken links on the Wayback Machine, and
[T] bukuserver offers a web front-end.

[U] https://github.com/jarun/Buku

